{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：10:28 2026-10-28 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"尖沙咀永利大廈銀主盤425萬拍出 低銀行估值約15%\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d3d97f679b300b544f7291356696c064/2026-10/KF_Yan_-_2026-10-28T104131_380.png\"/>\n<p>環亞拍賣行昨舉行拍賣，即場推出64項物業供競投，並最終拍出8項住宅、車位及辦公室等物業，包括6伙銀主盤、1伙業主盤及1項法院令物業，最矚目為尖沙咀永利大廈銀主盤獲搶高18%至425萬元拍出，屬低銀行估值約15%。</p>\n<img alt=\"尖沙咀永利大廈銀主盤獲搶高18%至425萬元拍出，屬低銀行估值約15%。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e3865766cd136eda85cf284bcfecd421/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-27_at_6_17_52_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f36a43786f3caea4d718c5ff29008c8e/2026-10/853153619_1603678991557069_7337405312788455001_n.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/50584c36f2620a526791c5c005193867/2026-10/851722247_1603678931557075_121933266098711330_n.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/20e19017f34b5a888f684f2adb2a46cc/2026-10/853087176_1603679118223723_6059741994914610575_n.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b9b7580a04368fe670a50233af0b658f/2026-10/853628841_1603678941557074_7761694800565007513_n.jpg\"/>\n<p>上述永利大廈高層D室銀主盤，面積690方呎，附連月租2萬元租約，至明年12月。單位連租約開拍價360萬元，最終獲搶高65萬元或18%，至425萬元拍出，較銀行估價的500萬低出75萬元或15%，呎價6159元。</p>\n<h2>赤柱龍欣苑自由價420萬售</h2>\n<p>而赤柱龍欣苑B座低層15室銀主盤，面積530方呎，銀主開價390萬元（自由巿場價）推拍，獲約2組客搶高30萬元或約8%，終以420萬元（自由巿場價）拍出，呎價約7925元。</p>\n<img alt=\"赤柱龍欣苑B座低層15室銀主盤，面積530方呎，終以420萬元（自由巿場價）拍出。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f62ffc6703220c10f70b679d7e902518/2026-10/855220506_1606803577911277_7690410228875627162_n.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/03dd9b00e524a5b17f7cb2c679bf38cf/2026-10/854415949_1606803704577931_1871200487312636501_n.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7d4781d448803a974ef2eddb9a9ab202/2026-10/855557406_1606803681244600_4297278338888413412_n.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ebdabfaa6a2bc5a4fb1abf03d6579e70/2026-10/855502779_1606803624577939_1243913838442714852_n.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c57c80853c05fa2b2e03b491631883ae/2026-10/854880584_1606803751244593_1817695204045106612_n.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0409664b1fefc3de35cdd178c49de85c/2026-10/857193919_1606803557911279_5086528585437312908_n.jpg\"/>\n<p>灣仔昌業大廈中層戶，面積570方呎，同屬銀主盤，開拍價350萬元，獲3枱客搶高60萬元或17%，以410萬元拍出，呎價約7193元。</p>\n<p>油麻地上海街399及401號中層B室，面積400方呎，銀主開價160萬元推拍，獲搶高53萬元或33%，以213萬元成交，呎價約5325元。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T03:01:23.891768+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":476,"images":12,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T02:28:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T03:58:35.417592+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T02:58:28.306840+00:00","content_hash":"45eba259936d01641a8ba0098bc0dd2fc990b76e3498624688766afb58e7574f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}